{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAwLS0yMDEwL0dhbGUlMjBGb3JjZSUyMCUyODIwMDIlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Gale Force","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/hYUJzFGsfI1TpE6fsOYzeRaK12S.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n5ByVlLlEyxLkNx7wsxia4u0DaZ.jpg","description":"Renegade L.A. detective Sam (Williams) takes a role as a cast member in a reality TV show where he leads a quartet trying to find ten million dollars in buried cash. But Jared (Dudikoff) secretly lands his violent militia on the island in an effort to slay the cast and steal the money. And Jared is successful: Thanks to a corrupt producer, the renegade mercenaries find the cache of cash and start off with it, but Sam and his intrepid, unarmed teammates interrupt them before they can depart. An explosion-filled chase across the island winds up with the good guys trapped by the heavily armed bad guys, and it looks like the game is over for the TV show survivors. However, Mother Nature, in the guises of a hurricane and tidal wave, has other ideas.\n\nReleased 15 Jan 2002 · United States of America · Language: English · 96 min\nStudio: Phoenician Entertainment\n\nOn your server — Audio: English · Subtitle files: English","releaseInfo":"2002","genres":["Action","Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.7","runtime":"96 min","cast":["Treat Williams","Susan Walters","Cliff DeYoung","Tim Thomerson","Michael Dudikoff","Curtis Armstrong","Marcia Strassman","Dave Hager"],"director":["Jim Wynorski"],"released":"2002-01-15T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Don't mess with mother nature.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Jim Wynorski","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/t0OGiUTL6vbFohfwI4dIUvoilSs.jpg"},{"name":"Treat Williams","character":"Sam Garrett","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jbRMOU2K7ePg7Zs59nfgEYLeD1e.jpg"},{"name":"Susan Walters","character":"Susan Billings","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/i3XQLCbYrNaa1yng2hL